William Kelley and Earl W.

20
01:16:21,818 --> 01:16:27,818
Wallace won the Writers Guild of America Award for Best Original Screenplay and the 1986 Edgar
Award for Best Motion Picture Screenplay presented by the Mystery Writers of America.

